    <string name="areas_note">Swipes down and up work in the side and bottom areas; down picks the left or right half of the screen. The bottom area goes up to the middle of the screen at most. Double tap works on an empty place; a tap on an icon does not wait. The larger the area, the easier a swipe is caught, but inside it the page does not follow the finger. To move an icon long press, let go at the vibration, then long press again and drag: the areas come back the chosen time after the last touch.</string>
