    <string name="dnd_note_calls">Alarms, starred contacts and repeat callers within 15 min get through. If Wi-Fi drops it turns off after 3 min. When in doubt, the phone rings.</string>
    <string name="dnd_note_names">Android does not give apps the list of saved networks, so the networks around are shown or the name is typed. The name is read with the location permission; your location is not sent anywhere, and another network with the same name also counts as home. When the name cannot be read, the network is known by the router\'s addresses.</string>
    <string name="dnd_note_own">Turn OFF the phone\'s own scheduled Do Not Disturb / Sleep mode: of two rules the quietest one wins.</string>
